      {
        "day_number": "Day 03",
        "day_title": "Purple Hut to Farm Cottage",
        "day_date": "25-Oct-2020",
        "day_comment": "We took our time to get ready for the last walk of this trip. As stated in the guide it was a very relaxing stroll back to the farmhouse. The track went first through some native bush before, turning into multiple crossings of the shallow clear-water stream. Nothing extreme, just a little bit different from the rest of the walk. Around midday, we reached the end point of our journey, station Homestead. We packed the car, said goodbye to our hosts and co-walkers and drove back home.",
